deleteSensor [SimTalk] - Tank
Deletes the specified sensor from the Tank designated by <Path>.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.deleteSensor(SensorID:integer) 
Parameter
The parameter SensorID of data type integer designates the SensorID.
Example
MyTank.deleteSensor(2)
