existsSensorID [SimTalk] - Tank
Returns if the specified sensor exists (true) or does not exist (false) in the Tank designated by <Path>.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.existsSensorID(SensorID:integer) → boolean
Parameter
The parameter SensorID of data type integer designates the SensorID.
Return Value
The return value has the data type boolean.
Example
print MyTank.existsSensorID(2)
