sensorID [SimTalk] - Tank
Returns the designated sensor of the Tank designated by <Path>.
Remarks
The methods sensorNo(SensorID:integer) and sensorID(SensorID:integer) may reference different sensors.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.sensorID(SensorID:integer) → any
Parameter
The parameter SensorID of data type integer designates the unique Sensor-ID which Plant Simulation
assigns when you create the sensor.
Return Value
The return value has the data type any.
Example
MyTank.SensorID(3).Exceeded := true
if MyTank.SensorID(3).Exceeded = true then
   ?.EntranceLocked := true
end
SimTalk
